
@startuml
top to bottom direction

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype spline
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentPadding 15

actor "Customer" as customer
actor "Courier" as courier

component "Customer App" as app
component "Menu and Customization" as menu
component "Pricing and Checkout" as pricing
component "Order Management" as orders
component "Payment Gateway" as payment
component "Tracking Delivery" as delivery
component "Courier App" as courierApp

customer -down-> app

app ..> menu : 1. Customize pizza
app ..> orders : 2. Create order

menu ..> orders : Перевірка інгредієнтів

app ..> pricing : 3. Get total price
orders ..> pricing : Запит фінальної суми

app ..> payment : 4. Process payment
payment ..> orders : Підтвердження оплати

app ..> delivery : 5. Track delivery
orders ..> delivery : Передача замовлення кур'єру

courier -down-> courierApp
courierApp ..> delivery : Update delivery status

@enduml